  "prefLabel": "Per 102.17 Broad group specification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.17 “Broad group specification” means a document containing a description of an occupation and the typical tasks, knowledge, skills, and abilities, as well as the applicable minimum qualifications and factor ratings, applying to job titles within a broad group. The term includes “class specification.”\n\nSource. #13667, eff 6-22-23; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.15), eff 12-1-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/per100-1500.html"
